{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"d87d30d08e497611aec9362e6ec28f714c2d39f34b077c6fe06791e5d70ee75e","slug":"attachments","location":"/guide/phase-3/attachments.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Attachments and Resource Export","label":"lancarbon-phase3-attachments","authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Haojie Dai","given":"Haojie","family":"Dai"},"name":"Haojie Dai","id":"contributors-Users\\HAOJIE~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\lancarbon-pages-build-6WYntt\\myst-generated-uid-0"}],"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","free":true,"CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/Hao-jieDai/LanCarbon-Guide","keywords":["LanCarbon","Jupyter Book","MyST","Markdown"],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"attachments.md","url":"/LanCarbon-Guide/build/attachments-e6c00f8bc030df34ae9ce45646709176.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attach and manage files","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"CpmF4i7VZ1"}],"identifier":"attach-and-manage-files","label":"Attach and manage files","html_id":"attach-and-manage-files","implicit":true,"key":"bTlHVtZ6I5"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Choose Attach file in Edit to import a PDF, document, spreadsheet or other file (up to 100 MB). Dropping files into the editor also imports them. The Markdown link uses a managed copy; Preview links and Resources → Save a copy let you save the file to another location without launching it automatically.","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"gt6zhr0ff6"}],"key":"s27JjFErg3"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resources lists images and attachments across your notes and Books. Search by name, reuse a file with Insert, and expand its reference count to inspect note titles and line numbers. A resource with no references is retained. The checker covers managed Markdown image/link destinations, reference definitions and MyST image/figure arguments; literal code examples are ignored. Missing files are marked in the list.","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"WiP3eGEyGe"}],"key":"sz9fRvPDCv"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Export and move","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"rxqhy5ABRy"}],"identifier":"export-and-move","label":"Export and move","html_id":"export-and-move","implicit":true,"key":"oKZrd4rLwx"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Export a Book into an empty folder. Referenced resources are copied into assets/, and links in nested pages are adjusted relative to each page. Shared files are copied once; unrelated resources are excluded. The desktop source stays unchanged. Export stops with a message if a required managed file is missing or damaged.","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"tsrlBJ40eM"}],"key":"iVA2saQ8jJ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build with jupyter book build --html --strict, then view the saved website with a local HTTP server. Move the whole exported project, including assets/ and the website theme files. Test an image and an attachment link after moving it.","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"Llr4IVTHYS"}],"key":"R6Ozl2Rexh"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Data Location migration also copies the resource catalog and files. For backups, keep notes.json, assets.json and assets/ together. Bibliography management remains Phase 3C.","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"vzoZjeE1xf"}],"key":"cZNbOJ5H3N"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Acceptance","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"C4Yfnclx6A"}],"identifier":"acceptance","label":"Acceptance","html_id":"acceptance","implicit":true,"key":"TQMTSbEtbr"},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Import an image and a document, then move the original files elsewhere.","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"PjwOBmZaqL"}],"key":"iLZka9Nsfq"}],"key":"khXLrpdVf8"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Restart and verify the image; save an attachment copy and compare it with the original.","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"key":"gau2yLb039"}],"key":"ER07TLDVP9"}],"key":"lhv021jWpt"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reuse a resource on a nested Book page and inspect its references.","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"XyBSZNCKMr"}],"key":"NkKktPa2h8"}],"key":"Nz4YrIqdlj"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Export, build, move the export and verify both links again.","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"sRgM9plIbH"}],"key":"N1SrNowRNE"}],"key":"ncllhMNnIr"}],"key":"JustwLCUcw"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"插入和管理附件","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"key":"dZY9drPfjY"}],"identifier":"id","label":"插入和管理附件","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"poG7fhSPOq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在 Edit 点击 Attach file，可导入 PDF、文档、表格等文件，每个不超过 100 MB；也支持拖入编辑区。Markdown 链接引用软件保存的副本。点击 Preview 中的附件链接，或 Resources 中的 Save a copy，可另存文件，不会自动启动附件程序。","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"key":"CeNrdDl8WR"}],"key":"e3fyAWGtX2"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resources 汇总所有笔记和 Book 的图片与附件。可以按名称搜索、点击 Insert 复用，并展开引用次数查看笔记标题和行号。零引用资源仍保留。检查覆盖受管理的 Markdown 图片与链接目标、引用定义和 MyST image/figure 参数，忽略代码示例中的字面引用；缺失文件会明确标注。","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"key":"xtS0oGaiux"}],"key":"Oil3ICwkV5"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"导出与移动","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"tZRHK6K7T7"}],"identifier":"id","label":"导出与移动","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"Xl8u4KV78s"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"将 Book 导出到空目录，引用的资源会复制到 assets/，嵌套页面的链接会转换为相对于该页面的路径。共用资源只复制一次，无关资源不导出，软件中的 Markdown 原文保持不变。必要资源缺失或损坏时，导出会停止并提示重新导入。","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"X6ZK0xRTxB"}],"key":"hWxilqzAD6"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":40,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"使用 jupyter book build --html --strict 构建，再通过本地 HTTP 服务查看。移动导出项目时保留整个文件夹，包括 assets/ 和网站主题文件，并重新检查图片及附件链接。","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":40,"column":1}},"key":"xJNelw9ri4"}],"key":"lsIKU9yALh"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":42,"column":1},"end":{"line":42,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"更改 Data Location 时会一起复制资源目录和清单。手动备份需同时保留 notes.json、assets.json 和 assets/。文献管理仍属于后续 Phase 3C。","position":{"start":{"line":42,"column":1},"end":{"line":42,"column":1}},"key":"e7SPXH4NUX"}],"key":"JS7MWUUflL"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":1},"end":{"line":44,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"验收","position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":1},"end":{"line":44,"column":1}},"key":"WrY563VRXX"}],"identifier":"id","label":"验收","html_id":"id-2","implicit":true,"key":"i2RrjKKCt1"},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1},"end":{"line":50,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1},"end":{"line":46,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"导入一张图片和一个文档，然后移动原文件。","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1},"end":{"line":46,"column":1}},"key":"JcwAV3plgi"}],"key":"koenorHM68"}],"key":"STbBAZFxzS"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重启检查图片，另存附件副本并与原文件比较。","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"yOnFJjUMf9"}],"key":"M3M1qdqUk7"}],"key":"wamsxcguEI"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"在 Book 的嵌套页面复用资源，检查引用位置。","position":{"start":{"line":48,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}},"key":"Vr6NbWMvSO"}],"key":"slVX9KPaIu"}],"key":"zDr9TwbaZQ"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":50,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"导出、构建、移动整个导出目录，再次验证图片和附件。","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"W9mVNZ2hdi"}],"key":"HoO0H6GgTo"}],"key":"jA5yzbf28R"}],"key":"T6x2ZKeqBx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resource tools update (1.8.1) / 资源工具更新","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"PwFTTbfoIi"}],"identifier":"resource-tools-update-1-8-1","label":"Resource tools update (1.8.1) / 资源工具更新","html_id":"resource-tools-update-1-8-1","implicit":true,"key":"Rd77upqsdq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Same-name imports now ask: Replace existing updates ALL references to the managed resource; Keep both adds a numbered display name; Cancel imports nothing. Physical filenames remain hashes.","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"key":"XIHui8sZy5"}],"key":"yNmIXIzPtz"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resources → Show resources separates ordinary Notes from Books. Select one Book, one ordinary note, or Unreferenced; use the checkboxes and Delete selected for a batch. Delete checks references across the entire workspace, including other Books and Book logos, before asking for confirmation. Removing Markdown links retains resources. Confirmed resource deletion removes the managed file permanently; source links are left unchanged and will show missing-resource notices. Shared identical bytes stay on disk while another resource record still needs them. Original imported files and previously exported Books are unaffected. Attachment reading remains a future feature.","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"llRjq98oug"}],"key":"N8ZupRXIEB"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"同名导入现在弹出三个选项：Replace existing 替换所有原引用使用的资源；Keep both 给新资源显示名添加 (2)、(3) 等序号；Cancel 取消。磁盘继续使用哈希文件名。","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"key":"GRLb4X9f5V"}],"key":"oEYWN4bqwy"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resources → Show resources 区分普通 Notes 和 Books，可选某本书、某篇普通笔记或 Unreferenced（未引用）。勾选资源后点击 Delete selected 批量删除，单个资源也有 Delete。删除提示检查整个工作区的引用，包括其他书籍及书籍图标。仅删除正文链接会保留资源；确认永久删除资源才清除托管文件，正文中的旧链接不会自动改写，会提示资源缺失。若另一条资源记录仍共用相同文件，该文件会保留至最后一条记录被删除。电脑上的原始导入文件和已经导出的 Book 不受影响。软件内附件阅读留待后续开发。","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"key":"qwXLOS0aHi"}],"key":"OPF8U8fGpe"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deletion update (1.8.2) / 删除行为更新","position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"key":"fVLFwVmqq3"}],"identifier":"deletion-update-1-8-2","label":"Deletion update (1.8.2) / 删除行为更新","html_id":"deletion-update-1-8-2","implicit":true,"key":"VpKTYwZOtZ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"From 1.8.2, confirming resource deletion also removes its image/link occurrences and image/figure blocks from ALL Notes and Books, and clears matching Book logos/favicons. Surrounding prose and literal code examples remain. This supersedes the 1.8.1 behavior described above. Removing only a link still keeps the resource.","position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"key":"JZagSxvt9u"}],"key":"yrTqIN9Or1"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从 1.8.2 起，确认删除资源会同时移除所有笔记和 Book 中对应的图片、附件链接和 image/figure 图片块，并清除对应的书籍图标设置；周围正文和代码示例保留。此规则取代上文 1.8.1 的旧删除行为。仅删除正文引用仍保留资源文件。","position":{"start":{"line":65,"column":1},"end":{"line":65,"column":1}},"key":"mRKJFR9O0n"}],"key":"YYvbtCgice"},{"type":"comment","value":" phase-3-acceptance-attachment ","key":"rplT3340cS"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":68,"column":1},"end":{"line":68,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Acceptance attachment / 验收附件","position":{"start":{"line":68,"column":1},"end":{"line":68,"column":1}},"key":"EeIVGAIFcu"}],"identifier":"acceptance-attachment","label":"Acceptance attachment / 验收附件","html_id":"acceptance-attachment","implicit":true,"key":"oFaqKF7wT2"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1},"end":{"line":70,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"link","url":"/LanCarbon-Guide/build/a662bf30fc2e013c6e1d-6b882c3884a60fb9bd580d945fb259dc.txt","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1},"end":{"line":70,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"LanCarbon Phase 3 Acceptance Checklist.txt","position":{"start":{"line":70,"column":1},"end":{"line":70,"column":1}},"key":"gd2PI90qgV"}],"urlSource":"../../assets/a662bf30fc2e013c6e1dec881dbe312716b338784ca4b3662bb93e78f8dbfc1f.txt","static":true,"protocol":"file","key":"pAEn5GSZBK"}],"key":"NgYxO0JPsO"}],"key":"V6iLfGe5W6"}],"key":"VVnhAeFjbr"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"n